WEBVTT

00:08.080 --> 00:09.480
I remember

00:09.640 --> 00:11.640
When I was still a prince

00:11.840 --> 00:13.000
In Dong Province

00:13.080 --> 00:14.747
I had a small courtyard

00:15.040 --> 00:16.160
Smaller than the palace

00:16.240 --> 00:17.680
But in my heart

00:17.960 --> 00:19.720
It was incomparably spacious

00:20.000 --> 00:21.400
Your son remembers

00:21.680 --> 00:23.680
Often playing and fighting with elder brother

00:23.760 --> 00:25.760
Messing up Mother's flowers and plants

00:25.840 --> 00:27.507
Got many beatings from you

00:30.400 --> 00:31.800
Your mother and I

00:32.000 --> 00:33.320
Are both old now

00:33.400 --> 00:34.760
As age advances

00:34.840 --> 00:36.480
We grow sentimental

00:41.200 --> 00:42.120
In the future, your son

00:42.200 --> 00:43.560
Will often come to the palace

00:43.640 --> 00:45.480
To spend more time with Father and Mother

00:45.560 --> 00:47.160
You're a filial child

00:49.480 --> 00:51.147
Your elder brother is too

00:52.880 --> 00:54.120
Not long ago

00:54.200 --> 00:55.840
His Majesty wanted to eat Qing Province's

00:55.920 --> 00:57.280
Fresh lychees

00:57.760 --> 00:58.400
So he ordered

00:58.480 --> 01:00.240
To dig a canal

01:00.320 --> 01:01.640
Between the capital and Qing Province

01:01.720 --> 01:04.240
But corruption ran rampant

01:04.360 --> 01:06.240
Not only delaying the canal's progress

01:06.800 --> 01:08.240
But also sparking rebellion

01:08.440 --> 01:09.720
Angering His Majesty

01:09.800 --> 01:10.680
To this day

01:10.760 --> 01:11.160
Prince of Ning

01:11.240 --> 01:12.907
Remains confined in the palace

01:16.480 --> 01:17.520
Looking at the board

01:17.600 --> 01:19.000
We've reached the endgame

01:19.480 --> 01:20.520
Just one move

01:20.600 --> 01:22.000
And you can win

01:23.160 --> 01:24.440
Your turn

